WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000
Create a practice quote, one step at a time.
This video uses fictional demo data. Nothing is sent.

00:14.000 --> 00:42.000
Search for the existing customer.
Check the linked opportunity and contact details.

00:46.000 --> 01:02.000
Open Form to request missing site information.
The demo request does not send an email or SMS.

01:02.000 --> 01:17.000
Load the fictional bill, then select
Assess bill with ArgonixIntelligence.

01:17.000 --> 01:27.000
Review the suggested values and supporting evidence.
In a live quote, check these against the actual bill.

01:27.000 --> 01:35.000
Choose solar, battery, or both.
Only the equipment steps you need will appear.

01:35.000 --> 01:49.000
The checked bill values carry into Energy profile.
Confirm usage, tariff and existing solar details.

01:49.000 --> 02:06.000
Choose the solar package and panel model.
Use equipment approved by your retailer.

02:06.000 --> 02:23.000
Generate and review the proposed roof layout.
This is a demo model, not a site assessment.

02:23.000 --> 02:43.000
Review battery options, then choose the brand,
inverter series and exact battery package.

02:43.000 --> 02:51.000
Check installation conditions and cable-run allowances.
The example uses an 8-metre allowance.

02:51.000 --> 03:18.000
Review savings inputs and calculation assumptions.
Modelled savings are not a guarantee or investment return.

03:18.000 --> 03:31.000
Review the materials, incentive date and agreement details.
Select the choices that match the actual sale.

03:31.000 --> 03:41.000
Price adjustment is the commission adjustment field.
Use an approved amount and recheck the customer total.

03:41.000 --> 04:06.000
Compare direct payment and finance terms.
Finance illustrations remain subject to lender approval.

04:06.000 --> 04:18.000
Choose the payment option and add customer-facing notes.
Select Preview quote. Nothing is sent yet.

04:18.000 --> 04:46.000
Check the customer, system, total and notes.
Review the roof visual and savings information.

04:46.000 --> 04:59.500
Stop here when practising. Do not confirm and send.
Get your manager's approval before your first live quote.
